      4 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَشْتَوْا</span></b> , (S, K,) and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَشْتَيْنَا</span>, (Msb,) <i>They,</i> and
<i>we, entered the</i> [<i>season called</i>] <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">شِتَآء</span>; (S, Msb, K;)
and ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">شَتَوْنَا</span></b>  signifies the same as <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">اشتينا</span> in this
sense. (Ham p. 117.) ― 
